      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "38 Leinster Avenue is a charming and beautifully refurbished two-bedroom period home, combining original character with a bright, modern interior.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is centred around an attractive open-plan living space, creating a comfortable and sociable setting for everyday living and entertaining. Charming period features have been retained throughout, complementing the contemporary upgrades to the property. There are two bedrooms, while the converted attic provides valuable additional space.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating and, to the rear, a decked garden offering a private outdoor space with the added convenience of rear access for bins. On-street parking is available to the front.\r\n\r\nWell presented throughout and thoughtfully refurbished, 38 Leinster Avenue offers an appealing combination of period charm, modern living and useful additional space.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nSituated in North Strand, Dublin 3 this remarkable house is surrounded by all amenities including schools, parks, restaurants and public transport. Dublin City Centre is less than two kilometres from the property with Clontarf DART Station just a five minute walk away.\r\n\r\nLeinster Avenue is a much sought after mature residential setting, a quiet street with excellent connectivity to public transport via North Strand Road. Connolly Station for Train, Dart & Luas Red Line transport options is just a 15min walk from the property.\r\n\r\nThe IFSC and Dublin Docklands are easily accessible via the newly opened Royal Canal Greenway. There are numerous shops, restaurants, and schools within the immediate area, with Fairview Park just to the north. The property is also in close proximity to the Port Tunnel, providing access to the M50 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
